      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLOREAT PICA (5) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a two-run winning streak, but could only manage second (29.79) at Sandown. One of the contenders. ONE MORE DRAM (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when third (31.17) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Expecting another good run. SAFFRON MONSOON (8) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage third, beaten 5.5 lengths (30.51) at this track in a Mix 6/7 over 525m. Expected to feature again. PAW LAPRAS (3) did a good job to finish second last time out over 460m at Warragul (26.31) in a Restricted WIN, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
